---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How CurioCanine handles information: no accounts, no analytics and no advertising cookies set by us.">
  <div class="container page prose">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: {site.policiesUpdated}</p>
    <p class="lede">We aim to collect as little information as possible.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>{site.name} has no user accounts, no comment system and no sign-up forms. We do not currently use analytics, advertising or tracking scripts, and we do not set cookies ourselves.</p>
    <h2>Dog Enrichment Planner</h2>
    <p>The planner runs in your browser. The choices you make are not sent to us or stored by us.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>This site is served through Cloudflare. Like most web hosts, Cloudflare may process technical data such as IP addresses and request details to deliver the site and keep it secure. See Cloudflare's own privacy policy for details.</p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>If you email us, we will use your address and message only to reply to you.</p>
    <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>This site may link to other websites, including sellers reached through affiliate links. Those sites have their own privacy practices, and we are not responsible for them.</p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is written for adults and is not directed at children.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If we add services such as analytics or advertising, we will update this policy before we do.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy? See our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
